        "# Context management protocol\n",
        "\n",
        "The context management protocol consists of `__enter__()` and `__exit__()` methods, used by `with` to manage setup and cleanup around a block.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-context-management-protocol)"
      ]
